(PREFACE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In preparing the present volume, the aim of the writer has been to) Tj T*
(meet all the college entrance requirements and at the same time) Tj T*
(to bring the study of botany into closer touch with the practical) Tj T*
(business of life by stressing its relations with agriculture,) Tj T*
(economics, and, in certain of its aspects, with sanitation. While) Tj T*
ET
