(  NOTE.?Heat in germinating seeds is not always due to this cause) Tj T*
(  alone, but is sometimes increased by the presence of minute) Tj T*
(  organisms called bacteria. Germinating barley and rye in breweries) Tj T*
(  sometimes show an increase in temperature of 40 to 70 degrees, due) Tj T*
(  to these organisms, and spontaneous combustion in seed cotton has) Tj T*
(  been reported from the same cause.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=27. Oxidation.=?The process that brought about the results observed) Tj T*
(in the foregoing experiments, and popularly known as _combustion_, is) Tj T*
(more accurately defined by chemists as _oxidation._ It takes place) Tj T*
(whenever substances enter into new combinations with oxygen. The most) Tj T*
(familiar examples of it are when oxygen enters into combination with) Tj T*
(substances containing carbon. It was the union of a portion of the) Tj T*
(oxygen of the air in Exp. 21, and of that in the tube in Exp. 22,) Tj T*
(with some of the carbon in the wood, that caused the burning. The) Tj T*
(effect was more marked in the second case because the oxygen in the) Tj T*
(tube was pure, while in the air it is mixed with other substances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=28. Carbon.=?The black substance left in your hand after oxidation) Tj T*
(of the wood in Exps. 21 and 22 is _carbon_. It composes the greater) Tj T*
(part of most plant bodies, and, in fact, is the most important) Tj T*
(element in the realm of organic nature. There is not a living thing) Tj T*
(known, from the smallest microscopic germ to the most gigantic tree) Tj T*
(in existence, that does not contain carbon as one of its essential) Tj T*
(constituents.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=29. Carbon dioxide.=?The gas produced by the burning candle in Exp.) Tj T*
(23, by the germinating seeds in Exp. 25, and expelled from your own) Tj T*
(lungs in Exp. 24, is carbon dioxide. Chemists designate it by the) Tj T*
(symbol CO?, which means that it consists of one part carbon to two) Tj T*
(parts oxygen. It is an invariable product wherever the oxidation of) Tj T*
