(  them partially with water, and in a fourth cover the same number) Tj T*
(  entirely. Label them 1, 2, 3, and 4; keep all together in a warm,) Tj T*
(  even temperature, and observe at intervals of twenty-four hours for) Tj T*
(  a week. What condition as to moisture do you find most favorable) Tj T*
(  to germination? Would seeds germinate in the entire absence of) Tj T*
(  moisture? How do you know?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
