(=41. Definitions.=?Organ is a general name for any part of a living) Tj T*
(thing, whether animal or vegetable, set apart to do a certain work,) Tj T*
(as the heart for pumping blood, or the stem and leaves of a plant for) Tj T*
(conveying and digesting sap. By ?function? is meant the particular) Tj T*
(work or office that an organ has to perform.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
