(=47. Botanical terms.=?As the prefixes _hypo_ and _epi_ are of) Tj T*
(frequent occurrence in botanical works, it will aid in understanding) Tj T*
(their various compounds if you will remember that _hypo_ always) Tj T*
(refers to something below or beneath, and _epi_, to something over) Tj T*
(or above. With this idea in mind you will see that botanical terms) Tj T*
(are a labor-saving device, since it is much easier, in making notes,) Tj T*
(to use a single descriptive word than to write out the long English) Tj T*
(equivalent, such as ?the part under \(or over\) the cotyledons.?) Tj T*
