(=61. Definition.=?Tissue is a word used to denote any animal or) Tj T*
(vegetable substance having a uniform structure organized to perform) Tj T*
(a particular office or function. Thus, for instance, we have bony) Tj T*
(tissue and muscular tissue in animals; that is, tissue made of bone) Tj T*
(substance and muscle substance and doing the work of bone and muscle) Tj T*
(respectively. Likewise in plants, we have strengthening tissue) Tj T*
(made up of hard, thick-walled cells, serving mainly for purposes) Tj T*
(of mechanical support, and vascular tissue, made up of conducting) Tj T*
(vessels for conveying sap?and so on, for every separate function.) Tj T*
