(lily, underground stems may be useful in preventing the too rapid) Tj T*
(evaporation that would take place through aërial stems. Defense) Tj T*
(against frost, cold, heat, and other dangers, as well as quickness of) Tj T*
(propagation, are also attained or assisted by this means.) Tj T*
