(=108. Morphology= is the part of botany that treats of the origin,) Tj T*
(form, and uses of the different organs of plants, and of the) Tj T*
(modifications they undergo in adapting themselves to changes of) Tj T*
(condition or function. Organs or parts that have the same origin) Tj T*
