(can easily be distinguished: \(1\) the epidermis, _e_, Fig. 119; \(2\)) Tj T*
(the primary cortex, _c_; \(3\) a ring of fibrovascular bundles, _f_;) Tj T*
(and \(4\) a central cylinder of parenchyma, _p_. In some specimens) Tj T*
(there will be a fifth region, the pith, which will appear in the) Tj T*
(section as a white circular spot in the center of the parenchyma.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
