(circular line will be seen running through the ring of bundles nearly) Tj T*
(midway between their inner and outer extremities, connecting them) Tj T*
(into an unbroken circle around the central cylinder. This is the) Tj T*
(_cambium_ layer, which supplies the vascular region with materials) Tj T*
(for new growth, and thus enables dicotyl stems to increase in) Tj T*
(diameter by the successive addition of fresh vascular rings from year) Tj T*
(to year.) Tj T*
