(=138. Practical bearings.=?This part of our subject is closely) Tj T*
(related to lumbering and forestry. The business of the lumberman is) Tj T*
(to manufacture growing trees into merchantable timber, and to do this) Tj T*
(successfully he must understand enough about the structure of wood) Tj T*
(to cut his boards to the best advantage, both for economy and for) Tj T*
(bringing out the grain so as to produce the most desirable effects) Tj T*
(for ornamental purposes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
