(pair of buds. In the first case there results the zigzag spray) Tj T*
(characteristic of such trees as the beech and elm \(Fig. 155, _B_\); in) Tj T*
(the second, the two-forked, or _dichotomous_ branching, exemplified) Tj T*
(by the buckeye, horse-chestnut, jimson weed, mistletoe, and dogwood) Tj T*
(\(Fig. 155, _A_\).) Tj T*
