(=157. Dormant buds.=?A bud may often lie dormant for months or even) Tj T*
(years, and then, through the injury or destruction of its stronger) Tj T*
(rivals, or some other favoring cause, develop into a branch. Such) Tj T*
(buds are said to be _latent_ or _dormant_. The sprouts that often put) Tj T*
