(=164. Significance of the clustered arrangement.=?As a general thing) Tj T*
(the clustered arrangement marks a higher stage of development than) Tj T*
(the solitary, just as in human life the rudest social state is a) Tj T*
(distinct advance upon the isolated condition of the savage. In plant) Tj T*
(life it is the beginning of a system of coöperation and division of) Tj T*
(labor among the associated members of the flower cluster, as will be) Tj T*
(seen later when we take up the study of the flower.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
