(  \(1\) In connection with 144-154, the characteristic modes of) Tj T*
(  branching among the common trees and shrubs of each neighborhood) Tj T*
(  should be observed and accounted for. The naked branches of the) Tj T*
(  winter woods afford exceptional opportunities for studies of this) Tj T*
