(  the effect of the mode of branching upon the general outline of) Tj T*
(  the tree; compare the direction and mode of growth of the larger) Tj T*
(  boughs with that of small twigs in the same species, and see if) Tj T*
(  there is any general correspondence between them; note the absence) Tj T*
