(  for it. Account for the flat sprays of trees like the elm, beech,) Tj T*
(  hackberry, etc.; the irregular stumpy branches of the oak and) Tj T*
(  walnut; the stiff straight twigs of the ash; the zigzag switches of) Tj T*
(  the black locust, Osage orange, elm, and linden. Measure the twigs) Tj T*
(  on various species, and see if there is any relation between the) Tj T*
(  length and thickness of branches. Notice the different trend of) Tj T*
(  the upper, middle, and lower boughs in most trees, and account for) Tj T*
