(  hickories, hawthorns, and pines, for instance, and notice whether) Tj T*
(  it is, as a general thing, uniform among the species of the same) Tj T*
(  group, and how it differs from that of other groups.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  \(2\) In connection with 155-158, buds of as many different kinds) Tj T*
