(leaves.=?Phyllotaxy is of importance chiefly on account of its) Tj T*
(influence on the light relation of leaves. A compact, close-ranked) Tj T*
(arrangement tends to shut off the light from the lower nodes, and) Tj T*
(hence, in plants where it prevails, the leaves are apt to be long) Tj T*
(and narrow in proportion to the frequency of the vertical rows.) Tj T*
