(platform to rest on while gathering pollen or honey? What is the use) Tj T*
(of the arched upper lip? Cut it away and notice the exposed condition) Tj T*
(of the stamens and pistil. Turn a flower upside down; what would be) Tj T*
(the effect on a visiting bee or butterfly? \(Exps. 83, 84.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
