(dehiscence; _b_, an anther dehiscing longitudinally, with pollen;) Tj T*
(_c_, filament; _d_, base of floral leaves; _e_, nectaries; _f_, wall) Tj T*
(of carpels; _g_, style; _h_, stigma; _i_, germinating pollen grains;) Tj T*
(_m_, a pollen tube which has reached and entered the micropyle of the) Tj T*
