(  EXPERIMENT 79. CAN A FLOWER BE FERTILIZED WITH POLLEN OF A) Tj T*
(  DIFFERENT KIND??Dust the stigma of a tulip or a lily, from which) Tj T*
(  the stamens have been removed, with pollen from a narcissus, iris,) Tj T*
