(  generations. This is hardly practicable for class work, but) Tj T*
(  students who are specially interested in the subject may carry) Tj T*
(  on experiments at home, or supply their place, to some extent,) Tj T*
(  by observations out of doors, if there are any farms or gardens) Tj T*
(  accessible.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Illustration: FIGS. 334-335.?Seeds of Bartlett pear, showing the) Tj T*
