(  MATERIAL.?In spring, catkins of forest trees, staminate and) Tj T*
(  pistillate flowers of pine. At nearly all seasons, heads of grain) Tj T*
(  and panicles of various kinds of grass can be obtained. For) Tj T*
(  experiment, a potted plant of any kind, just about to bloom, may be) Tj T*
(  used.) Tj T*
