(  by these? What kinds? Does this account for the noisome smells) Tj T*
(  of the ?carrion-flower? and skunk cabbage? What kinds of insects) Tj T*
(  are attracted by sweet-smelling substances? Do the greater number) Tj T*
(  appear to be attracted by these, or by foul odors? Are flowers of) Tj T*
(  the sweet-smelling or the foul-smelling kind more common in nature?) Tj T*
(  Do insects seem to be more strongly influenced by colors or by) Tj T*
(  odors?) Tj T*
