(unfold their beauties only in the sunlight. For similar reasons,) Tj T*
(night-blooming flowers are generally white or very light-colored, and) Tj T*
(shed their fragrance only after sunset. A nodding position is assumed) Tj T*
(by many flowers at night, or during a shower, to keep the pollen from) Tj T*
