(peach stone, ?the stone is not a seed coat, but the hardened inner) Tj T*
(wall of a seed vessel or ovary; for a seed coat can never contain) Tj T*
(more than one seed, any more than the same skin can contain more than) Tj T*
(one animal.) Tj T*
