(invaders are those of the Russian thistle in the northwestern states) Tj T*
(of the Union, and the ?bitterweed? \(_Helenium tenuifolium_\) that) Tj T*
(has almost driven out the hardy dog fennel \(_Anthemis cotula_\)) Tj T*
