(=356. Yeasts and ferments.=?Yeasts belong to a very different order) Tj T*
(of fungi from the bacteria, but on account of their simplicity of) Tj T*
(structure and the similarity of their action to that of some of the) Tj T*
(latter, it is usual to consider them together. They are the active) Tj T*
(agents of fermentation, and include a large number of species. The) Tj T*
