(=364. Connection between barberry and wheat rust.=?With the discharge) Tj T*
(of the æcidium spores, the part of the life cycle of the fungus) Tj T*
(spent on the barberry comes to an end, and it is ready to begin the) Tj T*
(uredo-teleuto stage over again as soon as it finds a suitable host.) Tj T*
(Where there are no barberries, it is capable of propagating without) Tj T*
(them, either by adapting itself to some other host plant, or by) Tj T*
(omitting the æcidium stage altogether. The parasitic habit being an) Tj T*
(acquired one, the fungus, like some animal organisms that we know of,) Tj T*
(can often be ?educated? by force of circumstances into tolerating,) Tj T*
(and even thriving upon, foods which under other circumstances it) Tj T*
(would reject. The wheat rust is known to be capable of propagating) Tj T*
(year after year in the uredo stage, the spores surviving through) Tj T*
(the winter on volunteer grains and grasses; and in no other country) Tj T*
(in the world does rust do greater damage to the wheat crop than in) Tj T*
(Australia, where the barberry is practically unknown. This power of) Tj T*
(accommodation possessed by many parasites is one of the difficulties) Tj T*
(the agriculturist has to contend with in the development of rustproof) Tj T*
(varieties.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=365. Polymorphism.=?Plants that pass through different stages in) Tj T*
(their life history are said to be _polymorphic_, that is, of many) Tj T*
(forms. The habit is very common among the lower forms of vegetation.) Tj T*
(The fact that one or more of the phases are sometimes omitted, as) Tj T*
(the æcidium phase of wheat rust in warm climates, suggests the idea) Tj T*
(that it may be of use in helping the plant to tide over difficult) Tj T*
(conditions. Besides giving better chances of obtaining nourishment,) Tj T*
(it probably has the same effect as cross fertilization among) Tj T*
(flowering plants, in imparting increased strength and vitality to the) Tj T*
(succeeding generation. Wheat rust produced from barberry æcidia is) Tj T*
