(Over seven hundred kinds of fungi growing in the United States have) Tj T*
(been described as edible, but the evil repute into which the whole) Tj T*
(class has been brought by the poisonous qualities of a few species,) Tj T*
(and the difficulty, to any but an expert, of distinguishing between) Tj T*
(these and the harmless kinds, has caused them to be generally) Tj T*
(neglected as articles of diet. While they are pleasant relishes and) Tj T*
(furnish an agreeable variety to our daily fare, their food value has) Tj T*
(been greatly exaggerated. They contain a large proportion of water,) Tj T*
(often over 90 per cent, and the most valued of them, the _Agaricus) Tj T*
