(=392. Fertilization.=?In the liverworts, and in cryptogams generally,) Tj T*
(this process has to take place under water, as the antherozoids are) Tj T*
(motile only in a liquid, but the amount required is so small that a) Tj T*
(few drops of rain or dew will enable them to make their journey to) Tj T*
(the archegonium. The mucilaginous substances discharged from the neck) Tj T*
(canal attract them to the mouth of the opening, one or more of them) Tj T*
