(  rocks, or the ground. Consider how the algæ and fungi aid each) Tj T*
(  other in the different positions; could either, for instance, exist) Tj T*
(  independently on bald rocks? Notice on what kind of trees the) Tj T*
(  different lichens seem to thrive best and on which poorly or not at) Tj T*
