(=Taxonomy, or systematic botany=, deals with the family relationships) Tj T*
(of plants in the order of their nearness or remoteness with regard) Tj T*
(to a common line of descent. Its chief value is the insight it) Tj T*
(gives into the course of plant evolution and into the nature of) Tj T*
(the modifications that differentiate each group from the ancestral) Tj T*
